ype=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\)</span> is the least set containing all atomic formulas and\nclosed under the primitive Boolean connectives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>.  No quantifier\nclosure clause is present.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b456e6677109f36b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b456e6677109f36b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L$ (atomic $L$-formulas, see [[17-df-atomic-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ ($L$-formulas, see [[17-df-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFForm}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\n=\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nS\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L:\n\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\subseteq S\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in S)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in 